---
---

<section id="features" class="py-16 bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Recursos Essenciais</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 mb-4" fill="#00fa62" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#00fa62" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4" />
          <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Gestão de Tarefas</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Organize suas tarefas de forma eficiente, defina prazos e acompanhe o progresso em tempo real.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 mb-4" fill="#00fa62" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#00fa62" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
          <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
          <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
          <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Colaboração em Equipe</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Trabalhe com sua equipe, compartilhe tarefas e mantenha todos alinhados nos projetos.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 mb-4" fill="#00fa62" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#00fa62" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <line x1="12" y1="10.16" x2="12" y2="13.84" />
          <path d="M15.4 9.1c.1.3.2.7.2 1.1 0 1.9-1.2 3.4-3.5 3.4-2.2 0-3.5-1.5-3.5-3.4 0-.4.1-.8.2-1.1" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Foco Total</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Minimize distrações e mantenha o foco no que realmente importa para atingir suas metas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
